---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact & Corrections"
  description="Report a reproducible image-processing problem or a correction to a Dama Image Prep guide."
  noindex
  activeNav="/contact/"
  ><header class="legal-hero legal-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">DAMA IMAGE PREP</p><h1>Contact & Corrections</h1>
  </header><section class="legal-content legal-shell">
    <p>
      The current technical-contact channel is the project’s public GitHub issue
      tracker. A GitHub account is required to submit a report. This is not a
      private email or live chat service.
    </p><p>
      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://github.com/huynjuunn-glitch/Milo/issues/new"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue</a>
    </p><h2>Help us reproduce the problem</h2><ul>
      <li>Page URL, browser name/version and operating system.</li><li>
        Input format, pixel dimensions and approximate file size.
      </li><li>Output settings and the exact error message.</li><li>
        What you expected and what actually happened.
      </li>
    </ul><p>
      Do not attach private photos or reveal customer details, addresses or
      confidential product information. A description or a non-sensitive test
      pattern is preferable. Reports are public and governed by GitHub’s
      policies.
    </p><h2>Guide corrections and privacy</h2><p>
      For a guide correction, include the passage and a primary reference. For a
      privacy concern, describe it without publishing personal information.
      There is currently no private support inbox; do not send sensitive data
      through the public tracker. We do not promise a specific response time.
    </p>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
